rule ScenarioSeparation
	lineageTag: c9205fe6-d6ff-5aa2-8207-45652991bbf6
	statement: Every budget line belongs to exactly one scenario and version. Always filter or split by scenario (and version) before aggregating Amount; summing Actual with Budget or Forecast double counts. Exactly one scenario is flagged IsActual, and actual data must never be entered into a plan scenario. Source: Oracle EPM Scenario/Version dimensions; SAP SAC Version.
	ruleReferencedEntity BudgetLine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty ScenarioId
		ruleReferencedProperty Amount
	ruleReferencedEntity Scenario
	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Line In Scenario'
